# Build context for api/Dockerfile (built from the repo root). Allow-list: send only what the image copies,
# so builds do not upload the virtualenv (~1 GB), frontend/node_modules (~0.8 GB) or the datasets.
*
!sim/
!model/
!api/
!surrogate/__init__.py
!surrogate/web.py
!frontend/public/data/surrogate.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
